            "notes": "I use cadeus ex on rounds 3 and 4. The rounds are mild and survivable, and you stay out of the way and pump out healing. \n\nAlso, start using supply surge on your teammates cooldowns. bind it to a comfortable button, you'll use it a lot. \n\ndon't waste it though, pay attention to key cooldowns to whoever is making big impacts on your team \n\nexamples: \n- ana's sleep\n- moira's fade / orbs\n- rein firestrike(s) or charge \n- brig's shield bash \n- ashes nades \n(and so on. whoever is the most impactful, make sure you're taking care of them) \n\n\nSome other key events: \n- Team trying to get around a corner to avoid dva bomb\n- Team leaving orisa / mei ults \n- Overtime -- use it on your team!",
